- #strong[Pool:] +2 Sōma
- #strong[Power tag:] #emph[I don\'t forget]
- #strong[Weakness tag:] #emph[will drop anything for revenge]
- #strong[Suggested Instinct:] \"Always ask strangers about the one I\'m hunting.\"
